<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>CSS Background and Links</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-image: url("tiger.jpg");
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: center;
            background-size: cover;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: darkblue;
        }

        .box {
            margin: 40px;
            padding: 30px;
            background-color: white;
        }

        a:link {
            color: blue;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:visited {
            color: purple;
        }

        a:hover {
            color: red;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        a:active {
            color: green;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="box">

        <h1>CSS Background and Links</h1>

        <p>Different CSS link states are demonstrated below.</p>

        <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">
            Visit Google
        </a>

        <br><br>

        <a href="https://www.wikipedia.org" target="_blank">
            Visit Wikipedia
        </a>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
